"Master Ladda-ser is the Artonan wizard in charge of potions at Central Crescent hospital."
"Her title is Master of Healing Objects for Humans; her potion mastery is not yet recognized."
"She is extremely introverted, likes humans and has dull brown hair."
"She is inventing an enchanted external heart for humans; Alden preserved her test doll."
"Her assistant Panna-ser guards her from being bothered."
"Panna-ser is her brother."
"She repaired a flawed artificial womb close to perfection in forty-five minutes."
